      "status": "doing",
      "reason": "T732's production comparator changes correctly implement sporting-quality ordering while preserving request bands and financial verdicts; the reviewer reran scout-search.test.ts and all 16 passed. The measurement harness has a blocking free-arrival accounting error, so its paid/free reports cannot yet support the economic comparison. Fix the reporting and add a small synthetic regression; no simulation-rule expansion is needed.",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-09T02:01:20.473Z",
      "startCommit": "67ace414b926e87f387e4c4513cae1d81defb0fe",
      "submittedBase": "4494c01f642b16b1b09581802190bfe1361ca8be",
      "submissionId": "e8fa0f30-0e56-4161-b228-3c47f5e63b36",
      "submittedAt": "2026-11-09T02:11:45.164Z",
      "risk": null,
      "reviewHistory": [
        {
          "id": "75cc9f53-97f4-44b5-9d51-f16da255cd5f",
          "owner": "ec09-reviewer",
          "status": "changes_requested",
          "verdict": "changes_requested",
          "summary": "T732's production comparator changes correctly implement sporting-quality ordering while preserving request bands and financial verdicts; the reviewer reran scout-search.test.ts and all 16 passed. The measurement harness has a blocking free-arrival accounting error, so its paid/free reports cannot yet support the economic comparison. Fix the reporting and add a small synthetic regression; no simulation-rule expansion is needed.",
          "findings": [
            {
              "priority": "P2",
              "where": "scripts/calibrate-cash-flow.ts:142-144,161-170,198-200 (T732)",
              "message": "The events list requires event.currency===closed.currency before counting free-agent-signing, but signFreeAgentAtClose calls addEvent without an amount and addEvent only attaches currency when amount exists. Every such top-up is therefore discarded and freeTopUpArrivals is always zero. A direct addEvent synthetic reproduction yields a free-agent-signing event without currency and filtered count0. Free arrivals also depend on completed bid history, which is capped at60 by transfers.ts:pruneBids, while recordTransfer deliberately records no zero-fee facts. Count these nonmonetary arrival facts separately from currency-filtered money, and preserve complete per-season free counts rather than depending on a prunable bid buffer. Add a small regression including a currency-less top-up and free delegated arrival, and expose correct raw source evidence so existing cash-flow runs can be repaired/reported accurately."
            }
          ],
          "commit": "ecb3a3ae00a057542194d9d43c1e04956fdd2615",
